            For most cedar decks, Armstrong Clark Cedar is the best balance of natural color, protection and easy upkeep. TWP 1500 is the better choice where mildew is the main threat, Ready Seal is the easiest to apply, and DEFY Extreme leads the water-based options. Cabot and Penofin suit owners who want an oiled, grain-forward look and do not mind more frequent recoats, while Thompson's keeps the budget low.
          </p>
